# Gore variant of the protagonist's death, 40x32 (the 24x32 body is offset
# 8px to the right so the pool can spread). hit replaces death_0, pool_0..2
# replace death_2.
# GORE SET (optional): hidden when the "gore" option is off; see docs/decisions.md D9.
@palette ../palette/night-school.pal
@size 40 32
@output ../characters/protagonist_death_gore.png
@preview ../previews/protagonist_death_gore_x6.png 6
@columns 4

# caught: droplets thrown back (replaces death_0)
